        "props": {
          "markdown": {
            "escapeHtml": false
          },
          "source": "\u003chtml\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003e Welcome to  Kanoa MES\u003c/h1\u003e\n\nThis is the main landing page whenever a user logs into the application and what is shown here can be changed by selecting a different dashboard and setting that as your \u0027default\u0027.\n\n\u003ch2\u003e Choose your dashboard\u003c/h2\u003e\nThere are a number of dashboards already provided and you can also create your own.\nWe recommend choosing the \u0027System\\Asset Overview\u0027 dashboard for now and this will give you an overview of whats going on.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\nTo pick a new dashboard, click on the \n\u003csvg xmlns\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n     viewBox\u003d\"0 0 24 24\"\n     style\u003d\"width:1em; height:1em; vertical-align:middle; fill: currentColor;\"\u003e\n  \u003cpath d\u003d\"M3 13h8V3H3v10zm0 8h8v-6H3v6zm10 0h8V11h-8v10zm0-18v6h8V3h-8z\"/\u003e\n\u003c/svg\u003e\nicon in the top left corner.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nAs you are seeing this dashboard, it looks like you are just starting to get setup. You\u0027ll want to start by...\n\u003c/html\u003e"
        },
        "type": "ia.display.markdown"
      },
      {
        "events": {
          "dom": {
            "onClick": {
              "config": {
                "script": "\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\"updateNavigation\", payload\u003d{\"path\": \"kanoa/mes/config/assets/assetTreeEditor\", \"name\": \"Asset Editor\", \"type\": \"view\", \"params\": {}})\n\t\t\n\treturn"
              },
              "scope": "G",
              "type": "script"
            }
          }
        },
        "meta": {
          "name": "mdAsset"
        },
        "props": {
