          "source": "\u003chtml\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nThere\u0027s a ton of stuff you can do with Kanoa MES. Here are some resources for you...\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e Check out our help at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://docs.kanoa.ai\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003edocs.kanoa.ai\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e"
